{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Selo 是一款專為運動訓練與學習專注設計的智能計時器，適合需要高效管理時間或尋求動力夥伴的使用者。這款應用將簡潔介面與強大功能結合，現在提供終生版<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>領取機會。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-28.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>離線語音與數據隱私</h2>\n<p>Selo 支援將照片轉化為動態貼紙作為虛擬伴侶，並加入智能語音提示，即使螢幕關閉也能持續鼓勵用戶。無論健身或讀書，它都能精確記錄練習過程，累積成就數據。所有資料僅同步至 iCloud 與 Apple Health，官方承諾完全不會收集任何用戶資訊，確保極致私隱安全。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-33-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-34-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-35-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-36-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-37-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-38-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Selo – Interval Timer 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Selo – Interval Timer</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/selo-interval-timer/id6821592190\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T05:20:29.602320+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":407,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T04:59:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T21:18:52.872364+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T05:18:10.114769+00:00","content_hash":"522ae1478f376c4626730a6a9829caeb9d3fef22d6827a79516438b2ffb17a4e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}